  <entry>
    <title>项目重点-责任链</title>
    <link href="/2025/03/12/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9-%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E9%93%BE/"/>
    <url>/2025/03/12/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9-%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E9%93%BE/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>在拼团商城中，需要通过责任链来定义交易规则。</p><h1>1、责任链和规则树的区别</h1><ul><li><p>责任链：处理者之间通过单向引用形成一条链，每个处理者只关心自己的逻辑，处理完成后决定是否继续传递请求。</p></li><li><ul><li><strong>订单校验</strong> ：在一个电商系统中，用户下单前需要进行多步校验（如库存检查[链节点1]、权限验证[链节点2]、支付方式验证[链节点3]等），这些校验可以通过责任链实现。</li></ul></li><li><p>规则树：是一种基于树形结构的设计模式，用于表达复杂的条件判断逻辑，每个节点表示一个条件判断，叶子节点表示最终的处理结果。</p></li><li><ul><li><strong>例子</strong>：用户发起拼团请求，指定商品为“空气净化器”（归属电子产品），用户为普通用户。系统从规则树根节点开始匹配：（1）判断商品类别为“电子产品”，进入对应分支。（2）判断用户等级为“普通用户”，匹配到规则A。（3）返回结果：该用户需3人成团，享受9折优惠。</li></ul></li><li><pre><code class="hljs">假设某电商平台提供以下拼团规则：规则A ：普通用户拼团购买“电子产品”时，需3人成团，享受9折优惠。规则B ：VIP用户拼团购买“家居用品”时，需2人成团，享受8.5折优惠。规则C ：特定节假日（如双十一）期间，所有用户拼团购买任意商品，只需2人成团，享受8折优惠。规则树设计为：根节点：用户发起拼团请求├── 商品类别 = 电子产品│   ├── 用户等级 = 普通用户 → 规则A（3人成团，9折）│   └── 用户等级 = VIP用户 → 不适用├── 商品类别 = 家居用品│   ├── 用户等级 = 普通用户 → 不适用│   └── 用户等级 = VIP用户 → 规则B（2人成团，8.5折）└── 当前时间 = 特定节假日 → 规则C（2人成团，8折）<figure class="highlight angelscript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs angelscript"><br>- <br><br># <span class="hljs-number">2</span>、责任链的作用<br><br>在某些情况下，请求可能需要经过多个步骤或<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>-<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>条件判断才能被处理。责任链模式将这些复杂的逻辑分解为多个独立的处理单元，每个单元只关注自己的职责，从而降低了代码的复杂性。<br><br>在实际开发场景中，需要根据不同的业务模型定义不同的责任链。在拼团商城中，可以定义两个链节点进行过滤，**节点<span class="hljs-number">1</span>**校验活动起止时间（防止活动过期或未开始）；**节点<span class="hljs-number">2</span>**校验用户参与次数（防止用户多次参与薅羊毛）。<br><br><br><br># <span class="hljs-number">3</span>、实现<br><br>逻辑处理器：用于执行当前节点的业务逻辑<br><br>```Java<br><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">interface</span> <span class="hljs-symbol">ILogicHandler</span>&lt;<span class="hljs-symbol">T</span>,<span class="hljs-symbol">D</span>,<span class="hljs-symbol">R</span>&gt; &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 执行本节点的业务逻辑</span><br>    R apply(T requestParameter, D dynamicContext) throws Exception;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></code></pre></li></ul><p>链路装配器：把传入的多个<code>ILogicHandler节点</code>组装成<code>logicLink链表</code></p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs Java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">LinkArmory</span>&lt;T,D,R&gt; &#123;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">LinkArmory</span><span class="hljs-params">(String linkName, ILogicHandler&lt;T,D,R&gt;... logicHandlers)</span>&#123;<br>        logicLink = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">BusinessLinkedList</span>&lt;&gt;(linkName);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(ILogicHandler&lt;T,D,R&gt; logicHandler: logicHandlers)&#123;<br>            logicLink.add(logicHandler);<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>业务链路：执行当前节点逻辑，完成后跳转下一个节点。</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs Java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">BusinessLinkedList</span>&lt;T,D,R&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">extends</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">LinkedList</span>&lt;ILogicHandler&lt;T,D,R&gt;&gt; <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">ILogicHandler</span>&lt;T,D,R&gt; &#123;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> R <span class="hljs-title function_">apply</span><span class="hljs-params">(T requestParameter, D dynamicContext)</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">throws</span> Exception &#123;<br><br>        Node&lt;ILogicHandler&lt;T,D,R&gt;&gt; current = <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.first;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span>&#123;<br>            ILogicHandler&lt;T,D,R&gt; itemHandler = current.item;<br>            <span class="hljs-comment">// 执行当前节点逻辑</span><br>            <span class="hljs-type">R</span> <span class="hljs-variable">apply</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> itemHandler.apply(requestParameter, dynamicContext);<br>            <span class="hljs-comment">// 跳转下一节点</span><br>            current = current.next;<br>        &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span>(current != <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>);<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>责任链工厂：构造责任链。定义了一条由<code>node1</code>和<code>node2</code>串联的名为<code>link01</code>责任链。</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs Java"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">RuleFactory</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@Bean(&quot;link01&quot;)</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> BusinessLinkedList&lt;T,D,R&gt; <span class="hljs-title function_">demo01</span><span class="hljs-params">(Node1 node1, Node2 node2)</span> &#123;<br>        LinkArmory&lt;T,D,R&gt; linkArmory = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">LinkArmory</span>&lt;&gt;(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;link01&quot;</span>, node1, node2);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> linkArmory;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>执行责任链</p><figure class="highlight abnf"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs abnf">R ruleLink <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> new RuleFactory()<span class="hljs-comment">;</span><br>ruleLink.apply()<span class="hljs-comment">;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
