    <title>项目重点-基于Redis实现具有降级+切量功能的动态配置中心</title>
    <link href="/2025/03/07/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9-%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8ERedis%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E9%99%8D%E7%BA%A7-%E5%88%87%E9%87%8F%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/"/>
    <url>/2025/03/07/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9-%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8ERedis%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E9%99%8D%E7%BA%A7-%E5%88%87%E9%87%8F%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>切量</strong>和<strong>降级</strong>是系统设计中常见的两种策略，主要用于应对高并发、系统过载或部分功能异常的场景。</p><p>切量是一种流量控制策略，指在系统面临高负载或部分服务不可用时，通过限制进入系统的请求量来保护系统。</p><p>降级是指在系统资源不足或部分功能异常时，暂时关闭或简化某些非核心功能，以确保核心功能的正常运行。</p><h3 id="逻辑实现"><a href="#逻辑实现" class="headerlink" title="逻辑实现"></a>逻辑实现</h3><p>Tip：下述代码只传达设计思想，并不关注代理类等具体细节情况。</p><h4 id="1-自定义注解"><a href="#1-自定义注解" class="headerlink" title="1.自定义注解"></a>1.自定义注解</h4><p>创建自定义注解，在需要动态配置的属性上应用此标。</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs Java"><span class="hljs-meta">@Retention(RetentionPolicy.RUNTIME)</span>  <span class="hljs-comment">// 运行时注解</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">@Target(ElementType.FIELD)</span> <span class="hljs-comment">// 只能作用在属性上</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">@Documented</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-meta">@interface</span> DCCValue &#123;<br>    String <span class="hljs-title function_">value</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span>  <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span>;<br>&#125;<br>------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><span class="hljs-meta">@Service</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">DCCService</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">/**</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">     * 降级开关：0关闭，1开启</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">     */</span><br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@DCCValue(&quot;downgradeSwitch:0&quot;)</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> String downgradeSwitch;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-comment">/**</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">     * 切量比率：允许cutRange%的流量通过</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">     */</span><br>    <span class="hljs-meta">@DCCValue(&quot;cutRange:100&quot;)</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> String cutRange;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="2-Redisson发布与订阅"><a href="#2-Redisson发布与订阅" class="headerlink" title="2.Redisson发布与订阅"></a>2.Redisson发布与订阅</h4><p>用Redisson的发布订阅机制，发布者动态发布降级与切量的配置信息，订阅者接受配置信息，实现类似MQ的功能。</p><ul><li>订阅者： 解析消息内容，写入Redis，获取目标Bean并动态设置字段值。</li></ul><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs Java"><span class="hljs-meta">@Bean(&quot;dccTopic&quot;)</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> RTopic <span class="hljs-title function_">dccRedisTopicListener</span><span class="hljs-params">(RedissonClient redissonClient)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 订阅主题</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">RTopic</span> <span class="hljs-variable">dccTopic</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> redissonClient.getTopic(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;XXX&quot;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 添加监听器</span><br>    dccTopic.addListener(String.class, (channel, message) -&gt; &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-comment">// 解析消息内容</span><br>        <span class="hljs-type">String</span> <span class="hljs-variable">key</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> getKey(message);<br>        <span class="hljs-type">String</span> <span class="hljs-variable">value</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> getValue(message);<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment">// 写入Redis</span><br>        RBucket&lt;String&gt; bucket = redissonClient.getBucket(key);<br>        bucket.set(value);<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment">// 获取目标Bean并动态设置字段值</span><br>        <span class="hljs-type">Object</span> <span class="hljs-variable">objBean</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> dccObjGroup.get(key);<br>        <span class="hljs-type">Field</span> <span class="hljs-variable">field</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> objBean.getClass().getDeclaredField(field);<br>        field.setAccessible(<span class="hljs-literal">true</span>);<br>        field.set(objBean, value); <span class="hljs-comment">// 设置objBean对象的key属性值为value</span><br>    &#125;);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> dccTopic;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="3-动态配置管理的工厂"><a href="#3-动态配置管理的工厂" class="headerlink" title="3. 动态配置管理的工厂"></a>3. 动态配置管理的工厂</h4><p>DCCValueBeanFactory继承了BeanPostProcessor，重写的postProcessAfterInitialization方法会在每次启动程序后对已经完成初始化的Bean进行<strong>后置处理</strong>。</p><p>后置处理：</p><ul><li>找到具有@DCCValue注解的bean对象</li><li>解析注解上默认的key:value</li><li>对Redis判断key是否存在，不存在则创建，存在则获取被订阅者写入的最新值</li><li>通过反射把最新value值写入此bean对象</li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
